@startuml
title Figure 4a-1  Activity Diagram — Pack Assembly and Plan Approval\n[Individual task · Member A]

skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam legendFontSize 20
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor White
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #444444
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #888800
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond

|Human|
|Concierge|
|Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
|LLM Agent|

|Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
start
:Materiality, risk register and objectives confirmed
(P1 gate step 1: PLN-01, PLN-03);
(R)
note right
  (R) is also entered from Figure 4a-2
  (Member B): GATE-R approve
end note
repeat
  :Assemble procedure pack per AuditObjective:
  trigger match, params and timing by risk level,
  dependency closure, acyclic check;
  switch (Coverage check (18.4)?)
  case (uncovered)
    :Add detail tests or controls
    for the gap;
  case (scope_limited_pending)
    |Concierge|
    :Present the gap the library cannot
    close (PLN-18 gate, ASA 315 para 33);
    |Human|
    :Approve the scope limitation, reject
    (more procedures) or withdraw (ACC-10);
    |Concierge|
    :Build GateDecision (disposition),
    submit via DecisionSubmit;
    |Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
    switch (Decision?)
    case (approve)
      :Mark the procedure scope_limited,
      it routes to the opinion (10);
    case (reject)
      :Reject: back to RiskAssessing (Figure 3a),
      revise the objective or its risk, add procedures,
      then re-enter at (R) after Gate_P1_step1;
      (R)
      detach
    case (withdraw)
      :ACC-10, Engagement -> Withdrawn,
      seal workpapers;
      stop
    endswitch
  case (covered)
    :Coverage ok;
  endswitch
repeat while (Every objective covered\nor its gap approved?) is (no) not (yes)
repeat
  :Create AuditPlan vN (status draft)
  with packSnapshot, immutable;
  |LLM Agent|
  :A4 drafts plan narrative for vN (PLN-15)
  from objectives, risks and procedure pack;
  repeat
    |Concierge|
    :Present plan vN;
    |Human|
    :Review plan, approve or return comments;
    |Concierge|
    :Build GateDecision (targetId = plan vN,
    decision approve / reject, reason),
    submit via DecisionSubmit;
    |Orchestrator & Rule Engine|
    :Validate target version and gate state;
  backward :Reject submission,\nre-present current version;
  repeat while (Version current and gate open?) is (no) not (yes)
backward :Record comments;
repeat while (Approved?) is (no: reject, N = N + 1) not (yes)
:Plan vN status = approved,
execution bound to vN;
(P)
note right
  continue in Figure 4a-2 (Member B)
end note
detach

legend right
  |= Lane |= Who |
  | Human | RCA; exchanges messages only with Concierge |
  | Concierge | A10; presents ReviewTasks, assigns manual tasks, collects decisions verbatim (form fallback: same fields) |
  | Orchestrator & Rule Engine | A1 (scheduling, validation, persistence, events), A5 EvidenceAgent, RuleEngine; deterministic, no LLM |
  | LLM Agent | A4 RiskAssessor, A6 FieldworkAgent, A7 ReviewAgent |
  |= Decision path |= |
  | All human decisions | A10 builds GateDecision / ReviewRecord -> DecisionSubmit -> A1 validates target version and gate state -> writes |
  |= Withdrawal |= |
  | ACC-10 | Any phase (Figure 3a): GateDecision.disposition = withdraw, workpapers sealed |
endlegend
@enduml
